    "summary": {
      "value": "Shadow Strike reduces MP and causes action loss with swords."
    },
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> you must have mastered <strong>Darkblade</strong> or <strong>Esper</strong>.</p><hr><p>When you hit one or more creatures with an attack from your @UUID[Compendium.projectfu.skills.Item.W5hE9L8x7AsJI7a1]{Shadow Strike} Skill using a <strong>weapon</strong> that belongs to the <strong>sword</strong> Category, each of those creatures loses an amount of Mind Points equal to <strong>【the number you rolled on your Might die for Shadow Strike】</strong>.</p><p>Then, if <strong>【the number you rolled on your Might die for Shadow Strike】 was 8 or higher</strong>, you may choose one creature hit by the attack: if that creature is your <strong>focus</strong> or you have a Bond towards them, that creature will perform one fewer action during their next turn (to a minimum of 0 actions).</p>",
